+## 2026-10-09 — Chart Lens website identity
+
+- **Summary:** Replaced the SV header badge with the owner-selected Chart Lens: a forest-green magnifying glass containing a chart with a restrained orange accent. Added one shared SVG asset for all website headers and browser favicons, including the error page favicon.
+- **Impact:** Scalable artwork retains the existing compact desktop/mobile header dimensions and readable Stock Value Lens wordmark. Financial inputs, charts and calculations are unchanged.
+- **Verification:** 37 Node and 4 Python tests pass. Full production build has 498 generated pages plus the error page; all 498 branded headers and all 499 favicon links use the new asset. Browser checks cover homepage, Apple, guides and updates at 1440, 390 and 320 px, with loaded artwork, no overlap/overflow and no script or asset errors. All 6,551 company JSON files and existing chart scripts match the preceding build. Publication evidence is recorded in VERIFICATION.md and the companion release record.
+- **References:** `web/logo-chart-lens.svg`, `web/index.html`, `web/404.html`, `web/styles.css`, `scripts/site.mjs`, `content/updates.json`, `VERIFICATION.md`.
