+## Chart Lens logo — 2026-10-09
+
+- **Scope:** Owner-selected original Chart Lens design recreated as a compact SVG with green ring/handle and an orange chart accent. Shared asset appears in the generated header, source template and browser tab; error page also declares the favicon. Header remains 34 px on desktop and 30 px on mobile. Brand text supplies the accessible home-link name; decorative artwork uses empty alt text.
+- **Checks:** 37 Node and 4 Python tests pass. Production build: 485 company pages, 498 generated HTML routes, 7,563 assets and 253,363,136 bytes. Audited all 499 HTML assets including 404: each has the favicon; all 498 branded headers use the SVG and contain no SV badge. Existing JavaScript and all 6,551 financial company JSON files match the preceding build. Homepage, Apple, guides and updates checked at 1440, 390 and 320 px: logo loaded, text and icon separated, brand fits viewport, no page overflow, no browser script or asset errors.
+- **Publication:** Published to https://stockvaluelens.com as Cloudflare version `7070a0dd-662e-4279-b86c-5580cb4d0c14` on 2026-10-09. Seven live resources return HTTP 200 and match the tested build, with SVG served as image/svg+xml. Live browser checks repeat all four representative routes at 1440, 390 and 320 px: loaded header logo, matching favicon link, charts rendered on chart pages, no overlap/overflow and no browser script or asset errors.
+- **Maintenance review:** Added a branding project-log entry and concise public update history. No issue-log entry is required for this routine implementation. Website source has no Git repository; focused source patch, SVG, screenshots and release evidence are saved in stock-industry-analysis for commit/push.
+
